%% Actor ordering per spec/21-app/diagrams/00-diagram-contract.md (AC-DG-001). Client is leftmost.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant Api as LicensingServer
    participant Store as TokenStore

    Client->>Api: POST /Auth/Token (email, password)
    Api->>Store: verify credentials
    Store-->>Api: UserId, Role
    Api-->>Client: AccessToken(15m), RefreshToken(30d)

    Note over Client,Api: Later request
    Client->>Api: GET /Licenses (Bearer AccessToken)
    Api->>Api: verify signature, exp, Jti not revoked
    Api-->>Client: 200 payload

    Note over Client,Api: Refresh
    Client->>Api: POST /Auth/Refresh (RefreshToken)
    Api->>Store: rotate refresh, revoke old
    Store-->>Api: new pair
    Api-->>Client: AccessToken, RefreshToken
